---
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site
	title="Plate: Repositioning a Print Brand as a Digital Platform · Steven Vanden Heuvel"
	description="As Creative Director at MTG, I grew Plate from a recipe database into a full content platform for chefs and foodservice professionals. 2017 Jesse H. Neal Award for Best Website."
	image="/og/plate.png"
>
	<section class="cs-hero">
		<div class="cs-hero__inner">
			<a class="cs-back-top" href="/#work">← Case studies</a>
			<p class="eyebrow">Case study</p>
			<h1 class="cs-hero__title display">Plate: Repositioning a Print Brand as a Digital Platform</h1>
			<p class="cs-hero__lede">Plate's website was only a recipe database. The work was to grow it into a platform that carried the whole brand.</p>
			<div class="cs-figure" data-animate="fade">
				<img src="/images/case-studies/plate/plate-scene.webp" alt="Plate magazine covers and a feature spread beside the responsive site on a phone" width="2000" height="960" />
			</div>
			<dl class="cs-meta">
				<div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Creative Director</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Org</dt><dd>MTG Media Group</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Recognition</dt><dd>2017 Jesse H. Neal Award, Best Website</dd></div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>


	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What was unclear</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">A whole brand online, reduced to recipes.</p>
				<p>Plate's website was only a recipe database. The brand also had magazine content, daily news, and blogs, but none of it lived online in a usable structure.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What I led</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">One responsive site that carried the whole brand.</p>
				<p>I ported the recipe database and grew it into a full content platform, organized into Recipes, Trends, Food News, and Magazine content. One responsive site that carried the whole brand, not just recipes.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Who I influenced</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">The design, and the business that shipped it.</p>
				<p>I led the design and worked across the business to ship it: the owner and president, the finance president, the Content Director, the Publisher, the editors, and the developers.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What changed</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">The rebuilt site won the top honor in B2B publishing.</p>
				<p>🏆 Plate took the 2017 Jesse H. Neal Award for Best Website. The site reached 42,000 readers and 56,000 monthly pageviews, and 90 percent of subscribers said the content shaped their purchasing decisions.</p>
			</div>
			<blockquote class="cs-quote">
				"What made it successful was not just the design. It was understanding how restaurant professionals actually worked and building something that made their jobs easier."
			</blockquote>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Design system</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">The component library behind this build is still browsable.</p>
				<p>The original Pattern Lab from the project, and the same patterns rebuilt recently in Storybook with interactive controls on the core atoms.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-artifacts">
				<a class="btn" href="/labs/plate/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the Pattern Lab</a>
				<a class="btn" href="/labs/plate-storybook/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the Storybook</a>
				<a class="btn" href="/design-systems">The full practice →</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-back">
			<a class="btn" href="/work/paypal">← PayPal</a>
			<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/work/blackbird">Next: Project Blackbird →</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Site>

<style>
	.cs-hero { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--gutter); }
	.cs-back-top { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); color: var(--text-mute); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); }
	.cs-back-top:hover { color: var(--accent); }
	.cs-hero__title { margin: var(--space-xs) 0 var(--space-lg); max-width: 20ch; }
	.cs-hero__lede { font-size: var(--text-deck); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.5; max-width: 56ch; margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl); font-weight: 500; }
	.cs-meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-md); margin: 0; padding: var(--space-lg) 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-meta div { margin: 0; }
	.cs-meta dt { font-size: var(--text-label); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-mute); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }
	.cs-meta dd { margin: 0; color: var(--text); font-size: var(--text-body); font-weight: 500; }

	.cs-figure { max-width: 100%; margin: var(--space-lg) 0 var(--space-xl); }
	.cs-figure img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

	/* One organism grouping: label, subhead and body sit tight together, and the
	   space between groupings is 25 percent narrower than it was. */
	.section { padding-top: var(--space-xl); padding-bottom: var(--space-xl); }

	.cs-body { display: grid; gap: var(--space-xl); max-width: var(--max-narrow); }
	/* Hierarchy: eyebrow + subhead group as the headline, body is support. */
	.cs-block .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0; }
	/* case-study eyebrows: nickel, normal weight, .03em, black */
	.eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-variation-settings: "wght" 400, "slnt" 0, "ital" 0; font-synthesis: none; letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
	.cs-block__lede { color: var(--text); font-size: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 32px); font-weight: 600; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.25; }
	.cs-block p { color: #5A6565; margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }
	.cs-block p + p { margin-top: 0; }
	.cs-block p:not(.eyebrow):not(.cs-block__lede) + p:not(.eyebrow):not(.cs-block__lede) { margin-top: var(--space-sm); }

	.cs-awards { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0; }
	.cs-awards li { display: flex; gap: var(--space-md); align-items: center; padding: var(--space-md) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-size: 18px; }
	.cs-awards li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-awards__mark { display: none; }

	.cs-quote { margin: var(--space-lg) 0 0; padding: 0; border: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: "wght" 400, "slnt" 0, "ital" 0; font-synthesis: none; font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 28px); line-height: 1.4; color: var(--text); max-width: 64ch; }

	.cs-artifacts { display: flex; gap: var(--space-lg); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: var(--space-md); }

	.cs-back { display: flex; gap: var(--space-sm); flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
	.cs-back .btn--primary { background: var(--text); color: var(--bg); border-color: var(--text); }
	.cs-back .btn--primary:hover { background: var(--text); border-color: var(--text); color: var(--bg); box-shadow: none; }

	@media (max-width: 880px) {
		.section--figure { padding: 0 24px; }
		.cs-figure { max-width: 100%; }
		.cs-hero__title { font-size: clamp(32px, 9vw, 56px); }
	}
	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.cs-meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-lg); }
		.cs-meta dt { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 2px; }
		.cs-meta dd { font-size: 17px; }
	}

	/* Case study links read as text, not pills: underline, accent on hover. */
	.cs-artifacts .btn, .cs-back .btn, .cs-back .btn--primary {
		padding: 0;
		border: 0;
		border-radius: 0;
		background: transparent;
		color: var(--text);
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 15px;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
		text-underline-offset: 5px;
		transform: none;
		box-shadow: none;
	}
	.cs-artifacts .btn:hover, .cs-back .btn:hover, .cs-back .btn--primary:hover {
		color: var(--accent);
		background: transparent;
		border: 0;
		transform: none;
		box-shadow: none;
	}
</style>
